@startuml
left to right direction
state "Intake Harbor 01" as IntakeHarbor01
state "Review Basin 02" as ReviewBasin02
state "Audit Ridge 03" as AuditRidge03
state "Release Gate 04" as ReleaseGate04
[*] --> IntakeHarbor01
IntakeHarbor01 --> ReviewBasin02 : submit\nreview
IntakeHarbor01 -down-> AuditRidge03 : side_check
ReviewBasin02 --> ReleaseGate04 : approve
AuditRidge03 -right-> ReleaseGate04 : merge
ReleaseGate04 --> [*]
@enduml
